WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:13.184
In a home kitchen, the cook mixes flour and water into a shaggy dough, then kneads it into a smooth ball.

2
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.271
They lift the dough ball onto a plate and pour oil over it.

3
00:00:25.596 --> 00:00:28.905
The cook kneads oil into the dough inside the wooden bowl.

4
00:00:42.428 --> 00:00:46.503
They roll each cut piece between their palms into round balls.

5
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:52.132
The cook flattens a dough ball and rolls it into an oval.

6
00:01:07.164 --> 00:01:09.428
They fold the sheet into a tight cylinder.

7
00:01:15.612 --> 00:01:16.866
The cook rolls dough.

8
00:01:20.828 --> 00:01:23.069
The cook coils dough ball into bun.

9
00:01:30.076 --> 00:01:31.446
The press seals the bowl.

10
00:01:39.932 --> 00:01:41.430
The cook dusts a ball.

11
00:01:45.596 --> 00:01:50.356
They roll the floured ball into a thin round flatbread, then flip it over.

12
00:01:52.718 --> 00:01:57.826
The cook rolls the flipped flatbread thinner until it is a thin, even round roti.
